v0.086: floating Save button on order edit, fix stale DPD services/order data after save

- Save button on the order edit page is now fixed to the bottom-right of
  the viewport instead of at the end of the form, reachable from any
  scroll position.
- Saving an order now invalidates that order's own cached data and its
  DPD available-services lookup, not just the Sales Activity list - fixes
  courier options not updating after changing the delivery country (or any
  other order field) until leaving and re-entering the page.

